  "ruleText": "Env-A 202.02 Limitations. Pursuant to RSA 125-C:16, III, no variance shall be granted for more than one year.\n\nSource. #1710, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss and moved by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95 (from Env-A 203.02); EXPIRED:6-30-03\n\nNew. #8128, eff 7-28-04; ss by #10187, eff 9-25-12; ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22",
